Id: record_first_aid_kit
Name: First Aid Kit - Stay Gold
Prototype: record
Room: library
Container: library_records
DescriptionShort: A vinyl copy of {{ name }}
DescriptionLong: 2014. Swedish sisters channeling Laurel Canyon folk.
