# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sitting Room entities
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

Id: sitting_room_chairs
Name: Comfy Chairs
Prototype: furniture
Room: sitting-room
DescriptionShort: Several {{ name }} are arranged around the room.
DescriptionLong: Plush armchairs upholstered in faded floral fabric. They look well-loved.
OnUse: You settle into one of the armchairs near the fire. The warmth and comfort wash over you. You feel your health regenerating.

Id: sitting_room_fireplace
Name: Fireplace
Prototype: object
Room: sitting-room
DescriptionShort: A cozy {{ name }} crackles on the wall.
DescriptionLong: A stone fireplace with a carved wooden mantle. A small fire crackles warmly.
OnTouch: The warmth feels nice on your hands.
OnAttack: You poke at the fire with the stoker. The logs shift and sparks fly up the chimney.
